NOTE ON BUNDLED BIBLE TEXTS

This MIT license covers the VerseSync SOURCE CODE only. The Bible
translations VerseSync downloads and ingests are separately licensed and
are NOT covered by this license. In particular the Yoruba translation is
licensed CC BY-SA 4.0 and carries a trademark requirement.

No Bible text is committed to this repository; the download script fetches
it from eBible.org at install time. See LICENSES.md for the full notices
that apply to each translation.
